[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13811.91, "timestamp": "03:50:11", "text": "我想只有烈酒和橙子，呃，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13815.11, "timestamp": "03:50:15", "text": "仅限亚洲版。哦，对了，埃杜玛也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13818.469, "timestamp": "03:50:18", "text": "另一个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13822.79, "timestamp": "03:50:22", "text": "我当时也想穿皮草。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13825.429, "timestamp": "03:50:25", "text": "活力太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13828.63, "timestamp": "03:50:28", "text": "现在很有意思了。等等，我意识到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13831.51, "timestamp": "03:50:31", "text": "现在就买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13834.469, "timestamp": "03:50:34", "text": "是因为人们会想……吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13838.229, "timestamp": "03:50:38", "text": "对，就像这个行业，我的意思是这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13842.229, "timestamp": "03:50:42", "text": "空间位于主导领导者的长矛中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13845.269, "timestamp": "03:50:45", "text": "现在女性 YouTuber 占据主导地位，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13848.309, "timestamp": "03:50:48", "text": "如果他们跟着[笑]就好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13852.07, "timestamp": "03:50:52", "text": "或许有效，或者其他什么方法，我也不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13854.87, "timestamp": "03:50:54", "text": "对男性 YouTuber 来说，这就像靠运气一样。"}]